    "version_difference": "CN and EN both contain 177 named dialogue positions and 5 unnamed time/location captions aligned by physical line. CN has 365 split physical lines; EN has 366 because of one additional terminal newline. Each source has 183 command lines. All command names and parameters match by line after comparing Decision option payloads separately; 7 Decision commands and 7 Predicate branches align with identical values and references. The 9 CN option strings are translated in decision_options_ru."
  },
  "progress": {
    "translated": 182,
    "total": 182,
    "remaining": 0,
    "next_ordinal": null,
